3C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd valign=\"top\" width=\"295\">\u003Cp align=\"center\">\u003Cstrong>Wissam Thamer Ahmed\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd valign=\"top\" width=\"295\">\u003Cp align=\"center\">\u003Cstrong>board member\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd valign=\"top\" width=\"295\">\u003Cp align=\"center\">\u003Cstrong>Hossam Ali Shalal\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd valign=\"top\" width=\"295\">\u003Cp align=\"center\">\u003Cstrong>board member\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>",{"id":102,"title_en":411,"title_ar":412,"market":293},"Agricultural","قطاع الزراعة","AMAP","1991-03-25",20506500000,"modren.com.iq@gmail.com","بغداد عويريج /الصناعية/قرب محطة قطار اليوسفية","Baghdad, Uweirij / Industrial Area / Near Al-Yusufiya Train Station","07901438037","https://api.isc.gov.iq/api/companies?page=1","https://api.isc.gov.iq/api/companies?page=2",[423,426,428,429],{"url":268,"label":424,"page":268,"active":425},"&laquo; Previous",false,{"url":420,"label":293,"page":7,"active":427},true,{"url":421,"label":263,"page":18,"active":425},{"url":421,"label":430,"page":18,"active":425},"Next &raquo;","https://api.isc.gov.iq/api/companies",[433,438,444],{"id":10,"title_ar":434,"title_en":435,"link":436,"date":437,"created_by":11,"created_at":437,"updated_at":437},"وردتنا معلومات مؤكدة باتصال بعض شركات الدفع الالكترونى مع شركات وساطة اجنبية بهدف استقطاب مستثمرين ومتداولين عراقيين لتداول الاسهم الاجنبية خارج اسواق العراق المالية من قبل شركات وساطة غير مرخصة لمزاولة هذا النشاط. نحذر المستثمرين (أفراد وشركات) من الإنجرار وراء مثل هذه الدعوات لانها غير قانونية. وستقوم الهيئة باتخاذ الاجراءات القانونية المناسبة بالتعاون مع البنك المركزي تجاه الشركات المخالفة للقانون سواء كانت عراقية أو غير عراقية.","We have received confirmed information that some electronic payment companies have contacted foreign brokerage companies with the aim of attracting Iraqi investors and traders to trade foreign stocks outside the Iraqi financial markets by brokerage companies that are not licensed to practice this activity. We warn investors (individuals and companies) against being drawn into such calls because they are illegal. The Commission will take appropriate legal measures in cooperation with the Central ","/news/2169","-000001-11-30T00:00:00.000000Z",{"id":7,"title_ar":439,"title_en":440,"link":441,"date":442,"created_by":293,"created_at":443,"updated_at":268},"برعاية هيأة الأوراق المالية العراقية .. سوق العراق للأوراق المالية يوقع اتفاقية استراتيجية لتحديث آليات التداول بالتعاون مع الشركة المصرية لنشر المعلومات","Under the auspices of the Iraqi Securities Commission, the Iraq Stock Exchange signs a strategic agreement to modernize trading mechanisms in cooperation with the Egyptian Company for Information Dissemination","/pages/360","2024-08-22T00:00:00.000000Z","2024-08-22T13:22:05.000000Z",{"id":18,"title_ar":445,"title_en":446,"link":447,"date":442,"created_by":293,"created_at":443,"updated_at":268},"هياة الاوراق المالية تستمر بتحقيق اهدافها بالحفاظ على حقوق المستثمرين بالاوراق المالية من الوقوع في مصائد بعض الشركات غير المرخصة ، حيث تقدم الهيأة شكاوي بحق تلك الشركات بين فترة واخرى والتي نتج عنها صدور الحكم القضائي وفق المادة ( 456 /1) من قانون العقوبات بحق احدى الشركات غير المرخصة","Iraqi Securities Commission continues to achieve its goals of preserving the rights of investors in securities from falling into the traps of some unlicensed companies, as the Commission files complaints against these companies from time to time, which resulted in the issuance of a judicial ruling in accordance with Article (456/1) of the Penal Code against one of the unlicensed companies.","/news/2024",{"categories":449},[450,451,452,455,456,459,460,463,464,467,468,471,472,473,474,475,476],{"id":7,"title_en":261,"title_ar":262,"market":293},{"id":18,"title_en":261,"title_ar":262,"market":263},{"id":26,"title_en":453,"title_ar":454,"market":293},"Communications","قطاع الاتصالات",{"id":33,"title_en":453,"title_ar":454,"market":263},{"id":39,"title_en":457,"title_ar":458,"market":293},"Insurance","قطاع التأمين",{"id":46,"title_en":457,"title_ar":458,"market":263},{"id":53,"title_en":461,"title_ar":462,"market":293},"Investment","قطاع الأستثمار",{"id":59,"title_en":461,"title_ar":462,"market":263},{"id":65,"title_en":465,"title_ar":466,"market":293},"Services","قطاع الخدمات",{"id":71,"title_en":465,"title_ar":466,"market":263},{"id":78,"title_en":469,"title_ar":470,"market":293},"Industrial","قطاع الصناعة",{"id":84,"title_en":469,"title_ar":470,"market":263},{"id":90,"title_en":291,"title_ar":292,"market":293},{"id":96,"title_en":291,"title_ar":292,"market":263},{"id":102,"title_en":411,"title_ar":412,"market":293},{"id":108,"title_en":411,"title_ar":412,"market":263},{"id":114,"title_en":477,"title_ar":478,"market":263},"Money Transfer","قطاع التحويل المالي",["Reactive",480],{"$snuxt-i18n-meta":481},{},["Set"],["ShallowReactive",484],{"$fGI6Hbj8Rma0bGLym-RAIZZxahVgrbGRAv0VJ0c-eXnc":268,"$fdAQ4OqQIixYgnKHsElIuqCGW8Ob5vTm4JNWkOTprULg":268,"$f7zuHB6v-akeF7Ur9hsaiyBqwbUK5OoysEOK6Bq94XwM":268,"$fV-sZUewgLG4u1b4QKN_Mdd_jHTWqCy7Y_Gzg0E-xbYI":268},["Reactive",486],{"auth":487},{"isLoggedIn":425,"accessToken":425,"user":268}]</script>
